{"id":"word:hebrew:H7068","type":"word","title":"קִנְאָה","subtitle":"H7068 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"jealousy or envy","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קִנְאָה (H7068) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 43 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קִנְאָה (qinʼâh) means jealousy or envy First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 10 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קִנְאָה","transliteration":"qinʼâh","pronunciation":"kin-aw'","strong":"H7068","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7068","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["קִנְאָֽה","קִנְאַ֛ת","קִנְאַת","הַ/קִּנְאָ֥ה","קִנְאָתִ֖/י"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",12],["HNcfsc",7],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",6],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",4],["HTd/Ncfsa",2],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HNcfpa",2],["HTd/Ncfpa",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"jealousy or envy","usage":"envy(-ied), jealousy, × sake, zeal.","full":"H7068. qinah קִנְאָה noun feminine ardour, zeal, jealousy (from colour produced in face by deep emotion); — absolute ׳ק Num 5:14 +; construct קִנְאַת Isa 9:6 ; suffix קִנְאָתִי Num 25:11 +, etc.; plural קְנָאֹת 5:15 , 18 , 25 , 29 ; &#8212; 1 ardour of jealousy of husband Prov 6:34 ; 27:4 ; ק ׳רוּחַ jealous disposition Num 5:14 (twice in verse); 5:30 (P); offering for jealousy, ק ׳מנחת 5:15 .18.25 (P); הק ׳תּוֺרַת 5:29 (P); of rivalry Eccl 4:4 ; 9:6 ; Ephraim against Judah Isa 11:13 ; ardent love , || אחכה Song 8:6 . 2 ardour of zeal: a. of men for God Num 25:11 (twice in verse)(P) 2Kin 10:26 ; for the house of ׳י Psa 69:10 . b. of God for his people , especially in battle Isa 42:13 ; 63:15 ; Zech 1:14 ; 8:2 ; ק ׳מְעִיל Isa 59:17 ; ׳ק ׳י וצת תעשׂה 9:6 ; 37:32 = 2Kin 19:31 . 3 ardour of anger: a. of men against adversaries Psa 119:139 ; Job 5:2 (|| כעשׂ ), Prov 14:30 (opposed to מַרְמֵּא לֵב ). b. of God against men , || חֵמָה Ezek 5:13 ; 16:38 , 42 ; 23:25 ; 36:6 ; || עֶבְרָה 38:19 ; || אַף Deut 29:19 ; Ezek 35:11 ; + אֵשׁ Isa 26:11 ; Ezek 36:5 ; Zeph 1:18 ; 3:8 ; Psa 79:5 ; הַק ׳סֵמֶל הַמַּקְנֶה Ezek 8:3 the anger-image provoking to anger ; ׳ס ׳הק alone 8:5 .","rootNote":"from 7065 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 10 16","keyReferences":["2Kgs 10 16","2Kgs 19 31","Deut 29 19","Eccl 4 4","Eccl 9 6","Ezek 5 13","Ezek 8 3","Ezek 8 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":43,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 10 16","book":"2Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִנְאָתִ֣/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 31","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנְאַ֛ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Deut 29 19","book":"Deut","chapter":29,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/קִנְאָת/וֹ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Eccl 4 4","book":"Eccl","chapter":4,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנְאַת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Eccl 9 6","book":"Eccl","chapter":9,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנְאָתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Ezek 5 13","book":"Ezek","chapter":5,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִנְאָתִ֔/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 8 3","book":"Ezek","chapter":8,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קִּנְאָ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 8 5","book":"Ezek","chapter":8,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/קִּנְאָ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 38","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/קִנְאָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 42","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנְאָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"ref